  "comparison_sentence": "Santra (2026) studies actuator-fault estimation and tracking recovery on a three-state reformer surrogate, whereas this note uses the distributed benchmark dynamics to test calibrated diagnosis of catalyst, membrane, feed and meter faults and measure the hydrogen-ethanol trade-off of diagnosis-based action beyond the feed pulse.",
  "detailed_comparison_sentence": "Santra (2026) studies Koopman-PCE/adaptive-control recovery from actuator effectiveness loss and input bias on a three-state SSMR-inspired surrogate, whereas our study uses the distributed benchmark ODE to test calibrated catalyst/membrane/feed/meter-bias discrimination under assumed measurement noise and compare bounded follow-up actions with feed-only continuations matched to the same diagnostic pulse and stopping time.",
